{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "ÖSYM Exam System Validator",
  "description": "REQ-1: Validates ÖSYM exam format compliance (TYT: 120Q/165min, AYT: 160Q/210min, YDT formats)",
  "version": "1.0",
  "when": {
    "type": "fileEdited",
    "patterns": [
      "backend/services/**/sinav_motoru_service.py",
      "backend/services/**/osym_exam_engine.py",
      "backend/models/**/exam_models.py",
      "backend/api/**/exam*.py",
      "frontend/src/components/Exam/**/*.tsx"
    ]
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "📝 ÖSYM EXAM FORMAT VALIDATION (REQ-1)\n\nValidate exam system against official ÖSYM standards:\n\n## REQ-1.1: TYT Format\n   ✓ 120 questions total\n   ✓ 165 minutes duration\n   ✓ Subject distribution: Türkçe(40), Mat(40), Fen(20), Sosyal(20)\n   ✓ Optik form interface\n   ✓ Timer warnings\n\n## REQ-1.2: AYT Format\n   ✓ 160 questions total\n   ✓ 210 minutes duration\n   ✓ Field-based question distribution\n   ✓ Optik form interface\n   ✓ Timer warnings\n\n## REQ-1.3: YDT Format\n   ✓ 80 questions total\n   ✓ 120 minutes duration\n   ✓ Foreign language questions\n   ✓ Optik form interface\n\n## REQ-1.4: Performance Analysis\n   ✓ Detailed subject-based scoring\n   ✓ Weakness identification\n   ✓ ÖSYM scoring formula\n   ✓ Ranking estimation\n\n## REQ-1.5: Study Recommendations\n   ✓ Weak topic detection\n   ✓ Personalized study plan\n   ✓ Resource suggestions\n\n## REQ-1.6: Auto-Save\n   ✓ Save every 30 seconds\n   ✓ Prevent data loss on tech issues\n   ✓ Resume capability\n\n## INTEGRATION TESTS:\n1. `pytest backend/tests/test_sinav_motoru_part*.py -v`\n2. `pytest backend/tests/integration/test_full_exam_engine_integration.py -v`\n3. `pytest backend/tests/integration/test_end_to_end_platform.py::test_full_student_journey -v`\n\n## MEB/ÖSYM COMPLIANCE:\n- Curriculum alignment (REQ-3)\n- 2300+ calibrated questions (REQ-3.2)\n- IRT parameter validation (REQ-10.3)\n\nProvide Türkçe compliance report with any ÖSYM standard violations."
  }
}
